guage","en","image","gameplay","Capture from the creator’s playable flight game.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/magic-carpet-wizard-astra.webp","alt","A carpet rider flies over a curved city toward a glowing ring.","https://threapchills.github.io/MagicCarpetWizard/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86],"其他 / 未指定代理","links","相关资源",[92],"resourceIds","section",{"_61":93,"_25":94},"Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","创作者开发记录",[98],"evidence",{"_61":99,"_25":100,"_101":102},"查看作者的 Astra 使用说明","https://github.com/threapchills/MagicCarpetWizard","note","The author-controlled repository description names GPT-6 Astra. It does not establish which coding-agent client was used or publish the initial session.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[107],{"_61":108,"_25":100,"_101":109},"查看完整飞毯游戏项目","Flight, enemies, spells, procedural world, audio, races and tests. Node.js 22; npm ci then npm run dev. No API keys; optional Google Fonts fall back to system fonts.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[115],{"_61":116,"_25":74,"_101":117},"Play Magic Carpet Wizard","Desktop WebGL2, mouse and keyboard. Enter starts; WASD steers/climbs, mouse plus left click aims/casts, 1–3 changes spells, Space rolls, Shift boosts, and R retries.","游戏平台","浏览器","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[125],{"_61":126,"_25":100,"_101":-7},"阅读作者的实现指南","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[131,132,133,134],"Play an adventure run and test flight and spells.","Read the creator’s attribution and audio notes.","Inspect flight rules, collision and rendering modules.","Adjust one obstacle or spell and test a retry and ghost race.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者在仓库简介中将游戏归功于 GPT-6 Astra。README 说明场景和贴图由程序生成，音频由外部提供；没有公开提示、完整会话或人类与模型工作的精确比例。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Three.js · JavaScript","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[131,132,133,134],{"_61":164,"_25":100,"_17":121},{"_61":116,"_25"